# AUV-150 (CSIR-CMERI + IIT-Kharagpur) digital-twin ArduSub defaults.
#
# Represents India's indigenous 150 m-class research AUV. Published specs in
# README.md: 4.8 m length, 0.5 m dia, ~490 kg, 150 m depth, ~3 kn (2-4 kn) max,
# 4-6 h mission, FIVE thrusters / 5 DOF, nav suite GPS+INS+DVL+altimeter.
#
# FIDELITY NOTE: the real AUV-150 ran a custom indigenous controller, NOT
# ArduSub. This twin stands it up on ArduSub (the range tests the MAVLink /
# autopilot attack surface); the HULL is represented by the BlueROV2 Gazebo
# body (a multi-thruster, vectored AUV -- closer to AUV-150's 5-thruster / 5-DOF
# layout than a single-screw torpedo). AUV-150's real hydrodynamic coefficients
# and its exact 5-thruster geometry are documented, not reproduced in the SDF
# (Tier-A body). Command-authentication findings are firmware-accurate.
#
# Stock as-fielded command-link posture (ArduSub defaults). Thruster mapping and
# EK3 external-nav source below are load-bearing for the acoustic/ExternalNav
# vector (same channel order the BlueROV2 body uses).

SERVO1_FUNCTION 33
SERVO2_FUNCTION 34
SERVO3_FUNCTION 35
SERVO4_FUNCTION 36
SERVO5_FUNCTION 37
SERVO6_FUNCTION 38

BATT_MONITOR     4
FS_OPTIONS       0

EK2_ENABLE 0
EK3_ENABLE 1
AHRS_EKF_TYPE 3

# No GPS underwater; horizontal position from acoustic positioning (USBL/DVL),
# fed to ArduPilot as VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE by attacks/acoustic_spoof.py.
GPS_TYPE 1
SIM_GPS_DISABLE 0
SIM_GPS_LOCK 1
VISO_TYPE 1
EK3_SRC1_POSXY 6
EK3_SRC1_VELXY 6
EK3_SRC1_POSZ 1
EK3_SRC1_VELZ 6
EK3_SRC1_YAW 6
COMPASS_USE 0
COMPASS_USE2 0
COMPASS_USE3 0
SIM_BARO_RND 0.01

PSC_ACCZ_P   2
PSC_ACCZ_I   4
PSC_ACCZ_FF  0.75
PSC_VELZ_P   8
PSC_POSZ_P   3
PSC_POSXY_P 2.5
PSC_VELXY_D 0.8
PSC_VELXY_I 0.5
PSC_VELXY_P 5.0

WPNAV_RADIUS  500
WPNAV_SPEED   100
